<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Eɓulu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sɛʋɛi Nii Teʋegai Eɓulu Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Eɓulu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eɓu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sɛʋɛi Nii Teʋegai</para>
  <para style="mt1">Eɓulu Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Eɓulu nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠa iɲɔdɔ zɛʋɛ ʋagɔ, é dɛɛzu ga Yesu ɠɛɛʋɛ ga faawokɛɛyeeluɠɔ ɓɔɛi ma mɔinmɔin daazeeliai Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu. Sɛʋɛʋɛ eɠɛ tɛnɛ goo. Eɓulu nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi zu, mɔinʋɛ puulɔzita (60) ma ʋɛti, kɛɛ nui laaʋilɛgai Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu vaiti ba, naa ɠa é dɛɛzu kpezekele ga Yesu GALA gooi ta Zuifuiti ta-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai losuʋɛ laazeeliʋɛ. Naa maaʋele ma, sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ ga é keletiɛinti iɲɔdɔ, niiti ti ga Zuifuiti. Eɓulu zɛʋɛi dɛɛʋɛ ga Yesu tɔgi laawooi ʋilɛgɛ su, nii a kɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti mina mɔ zalaɠa ɠula. Yesu ɠa kɛai ga kotoiti kpein ma zalaɠai, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe é kula ɠɛ su. Ada-yeeɠɛɠalai zu ɠeletiɛinti ta zoo ɓalaa iɲɔdɔɔ zɔlɔɔsu Eɓulu nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi zu, ga ti yeeyɛ ba, ti yɛ Yesu ʋolu, tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é ɠɛa ga zaɓui de zoo laazu GALA da, ta de yeeyɛ ba ga ade ɗa ɠaliva GALA ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 12:2">12:2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nu nɔpɛ ge la kwɛɛ zɔi é Eɓulu nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠɛai, kɛlɛ faaɠwɛ nu wolai tanigaa ti ɠisiɛʋɛ nui tanigaa zu, naati ta ga, keelai Pɔle, ɓaa Luke, ni naa laade Ɓalanaɓase. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓalaa sɛʋɛi tɛi kɛɛ ɠonagi ɠwɛɛ, kɛlɛ nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠisiɛʋɛ ga kɛɛʋɛ aisa kona ʋuulɔfelai (70) ʋa zeeli, Kilista zɔlɔɔgai ʋoluma. Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠoloni kona ʋuulɔfelai ma (70), kɛlɛ sɛʋɛi nii ma nui ɠa ɓɔɛzu, é ʋilɛ Zeluzalɛme ʋa, eɠɛ é la dɛ ɠoloɠoloni. Eɓulu nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ Wɔlɔme taazuʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:24">13:24</ref></char>), naa ʋoluma kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ma zɛʋɛi leʋeteʋegɛ Egilisi mɔinmɔin su.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui dɛɛʋɛ ga Yesu ɠa GALA goo wo nuiti ta geezuɠeelai maazu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-4:13">1:1—4:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. É li ga dɛa ga Yesu ɠa zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti maazu, ti botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Yesu ná-botii ɠa minazeɠe pɔlɔmai yeemaazu, nii GALA ge kpɛtɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta ná-nuɓusɛiti, ga tɔgi maaʋele nii é feeni Moize ya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-10:31">8:1—10:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Sɛʋɛi nii ma nui ɓega ʋoluma ga dɛɛ kɛʋelei pɛ su ga Yesu yee ɠa fai pɛ maazu, é kala mɔinmɔin feeʋɛ, é ʋilɛ nu ziɛ ʋeleiti ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 10:32-13:17">10:32—13:17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Gaaɓelagi zu, sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui woo ɠaaɓelagɛ ga iɲɔdɔɔ wooiti, ta tuʋɔ gooiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:18-25">13:18-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">GALA kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ade ʋɛ <optbreak/> ga ná-Doun Zunui maaʋele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Mɔungi zu, GALA ge ɓɔɛni ade-mɛmɛwolani pɔ, ná zeizu mɔin, ta kɛʋele mɔinmɔin su, ga GALA goo wo nuiti maaʋele. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Kɛlɛ niima voloiti su, ti ga yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagiti, é woo ʋua ná-Doun Zunui la, naa ɓɔɛ la ade ʋɔ. Tɔ ɠa é yiimazeɠea la ga é anii pɛ pu zeezu. Tɔ ɠa é eteai ɓɛtɛni ga tɔun maaʋele. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Doun Zunui tɔna ka é ga GALA ná-lɛbiyai ma voloi, é ga GALA ɓɔɠɔi ʋaaɠulabai. Tɔ ɠa é kpɛtɛanii pɛ suzosu ga daawooi ná-zɛbɛi. Kpegai ma ga kotoiti gba vai ɠɛ, é zeini geeɠɔlɔgi zu maazuʋɛ poun, GALA Maayikiai yeezazuʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doun Zunui wɔɔlɔʋɛ geezuɠeelaiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Doun Zunui wɔɔlɔʋɛ gola, é leʋe geezuɠeelaiti ba, ʋele nɔ ɠana é la ɓalaa, é daasei sɔlɔɔgɛ, nii bɔɔlɔai naati tɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ geezuɠeelai ɓɛgele ɠa GALA ge ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">«Ɗa ga dòun zunui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">za, gè è ɠɛa ga dòin.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Guy 2:7</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Ɓaa mu mɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">«Nà ɠɛ bɛ ga ɠɛɛɠɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">tɔun ge ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga doun zunu»?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sa 7:14</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Siɛgi zu GALA ge Doun Zunu mɔungi leʋeni da eteai zu, é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">«GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti pɛ ti nɔkɔ bu!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">TSV 32:43</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Niima wooi ɠa é boni geezuɠeelaiti ta-vaa zu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">«Tɛigi a ɗa ná-geezuɠeelaiti kɛ ga fiilɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">é ná-botiɠɛ nuiti kɛ ga abuzogi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Guy 104:4</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɠɛni Doun Zunui ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">«Ee, GALA, ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa ná yeenɔpɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">ɗa-masa tukpɔi ɠa ga telebo tukpɔi.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Telebodai nɛɛʋɛ è ʋɛ, è tɔ koloɠolo fai wɔinzeɠe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Naa ɠa é ba, GALA, ɗa-ƓALAGI gulɔi ziɛni è ma, koozunɛ wulɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">é yiimazeɠe ga ɗe è ɠɛɠalaiti saama.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8-9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 45:7-8">Guy 45:7-8</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>É ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">«Ɗa ɠa, Maliɠii, è eteai lɔɔɓadɔni tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ga è-yeei ná-kpɛtɛanii.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Ta ɲɛɛlɛ, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ɗa ná eyɛsu ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Ti pɛ ta wɔlɔzaɠa eɠɛ seɠei,<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>è ti ʋɛɛ su, è ti ɓili eɠɛ tookɔba wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">ti maa ɠa valibo eɠɛ seɠei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɗa yɛsu ɠɛʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">ɗa-ɠonagiti ti la ɓega ɠɔ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:26-28">Guy 102:26-28</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Geezuɠeelaiti su, ɓɛgele ɠa é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">«Zei zèezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti kɛ ga ɗa-ɠɔɠɔloma anii»?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Guy 110:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Geezuɠeelaiti ti pɛ tɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ ga zɛnvuiti ti GALA ná-botii ɠɛɛzu ɓaa? É ti leʋesu ga ti kpɔba ve naati bɛ ti maanɛai ti kizogi zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kizo faa wolai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, de maanɛɛʋɛ de ɠili kpaan kala gooiti ba, de ti mɛnigai, naa ɠa a kɛ, de mina ʋilɛ de undaaʋili pelei ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wooi geezuɠeelaiti ti daazeelini, ni naa ɓikpini, tɔ koloɠolo nui pɛ ta woomɛnitala nuiti pɛ ti zalai zɔlɔɔni nii soloogai ti-ɠɛɛwotiiti ma, <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>naazu da zoo ɠale de ɠizo, ni da kizo faa wolai tɛi kɛɛna ga faalakoba vaa? Kizo fai nii Maliɠii ɓɔɠɔi boni mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma mɛni nuiti ti bo ti maaɓakpa ade ya, <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>GALA ge ta-zeele wooiti maaɓakpa ga poogiti, ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti, ta laavɔɔ vaiti, naa ʋɛɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-vebɛaniiti ba, é ti ɠaaɠwɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei ziimai la.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi é losu nuiti tuɠɔ kizogi ma vai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Tɔɔzei eteai é ʋaazu, nii gè ná-fai zuɠulazu, GALA ge la zobogi veeni geezuɠeelaiti zea ga ti zei eteai naa unda. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Nui ta niima zeele wooi wogɛ adaʋɛ ta GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">«Nuɓusɛi ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa ɠigaiziɛ su?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Nui ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa yiizoolɛ la?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>È dɔiʋɛ geezuɠeelaiti ba yeeɠɛɠala go laawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">è lɛbiyai ta unfemai veeʋɛ bɛ, ti ɠɛ unma ga masa bɔɔlɔgi,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>è aniiti pɛ puuʋɛ ná-zobogi wu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6-8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:5-7">Guy 8:5-7</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Siɛgi zu GALA ge aniiti pɛ dɔai la nui ná-zobogi wu, é la tanɔpɛ zɛni ʋoluzu, nii é la ɠoloni bɛ. Tama anɛɛ naa ʋe, de la dɛ pɛtɛsu niizu ga aniiti pɛ ti ɠoloa nui ná-zobogi ʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Kɛlɛ nii de pɛtɛsu niizu, naa ɠa é ga, Yesu lɔini geezuɠeelaiti ba yeeɠɛɠala go laawu, naa ɠa a kɛ, GALA ná-zaalai maaʋele ma, é za nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ, da kaazu niina, lɛbiyai ta unfemai ti veai bɛ, ti unma ga masa bɔɔlɔgi, tɔɔzei saai ʋa é sɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="HEB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>GALA ka é eteai ɓɛtɛa, ta eteai ɠa ná tɔun bɛ. Tama nɛɛʋɛ bɛ ga é ná-dointi ma mɔinmɔin pɔɔkpɔ ná-lɛbiyai ʋa. Tɛi tama Yesu ɠa é ti ɠizosu, kɛni naa a la daazeelii pɛ sɔlɔɔ GALA zea ga kpɔlɔi maaʋele. <verse eid="HEB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Yesu ɠa é nuiti ɲadesu ta-ɠotoiti ma, tama, tɛigi é nuiti ɲadesu, ta niiti é ti ɲadegai, ti pɛ ti-lɔkulugi ɠa ɠila kpe nɔ. Naa ɠa é ba, Yesu la unfega ga ti loli fai ga kɛɛɠɛlointi. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni é ɠɛni la GALA ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">«Nà zeze ga è-laaseigi kɛ̀ɛleaiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">Nà è maamusɛ wuyei loo maaɓɔgi zaama.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:23">Guy 22:23</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>É ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">«Nɔ̀un nà, nà-kitogi pɛ ka ɠɛ ga GALA nɔ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">Ta mɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">«Giya ɠaa, gá dointi GALA ge ti veai zèa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Eza 8:17-18</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Tama, ʋelei naama lointi ti la ga kpusɛi ta ɲamai nɔnɔiti, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa ɠɛni ga ti ɠɛʋele, naa ɠa a kɛ é naa ɠoloɠolo ga ná-saai maaʋele, zɔi saai ma zobogi zea, naa ɠa é ga Inɛgi, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>é naati unmɔɔ, niiti kpein ti ɠɛni eɠɛ duɔiti ta-luai maaʋele ma saai ʋa ti-zii ma voloi pɛ su. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ koleʋɛ ga geezuɠeelaiti taade é ʋa ʋa ɓɔsu ti ʋa, kɛlɛ Abalaame mavofodaiti ka é ɓɔsu ti ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛni a la ɠula ga kɛɛɠɛleaiti fai pɛ su, naa ɠa a kɛ, é ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, daavegai ga gaazumaawɔinɠai, é ga wooɠɛɠila nu GALA ná-botii zu, ga é nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti gba. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, tɛi tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é ɓɔlɔni, siɛgi zu tɛgai zeelini la ma, toɠa zoo é ɓɔ naati ba, niiti tɛgai zeelizu ti ma.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wɔɔlɔʋɛ Moize ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo ga GALA nɔnɔiti, é wo loligai ga wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu vaa ʋagɔiti su, à ɠisiɛ lɛɛ Yesu zu, nii ade yeezeiɗai bu kɛlɛmaʋɛ ga tɔ ɠa é ga GALA ná-keelai ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>É ɠɛni ga wooɠɛɠila nu GALA bɛ, nii é ma losuʋɛ veeni zea, eɠɛʋelei Moize ɠɛni la GALA ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>É leveni ga soloogɛ é lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ, nii bɔɔlɔai é leʋe Moize nɔnɔi ʋa, eɠɛʋelei pɛlɛ lo nui ná-unfemai wɔɔlɔai la pɛlɛi nɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ pɛlɛi ma zii pɛ to nu ɠa ná, kɛlɛ GALA ka é anii pɛ toga. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Moize nɔnɔi, é ɠɛni ga wooɠɛɠila nu GALA ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu ná pɛ. É ɠɛni ga botiɠɛ nui, tosuʋɛ ɠɛni ga é naama zeele wooi wo nii GALA ge ʋaazu bosu. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Kɛlɛ Kilista ɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nui, é ɠɛni ga Doun Zunui seiɗai GALA ná-pɛlɛyeɠei unda. Ada ga ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti, ni ada da-ladalai zona kpaan ta kitogi, nii ade ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔzu ma vaa zu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dooɠogi makɛgɛ GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Naa ɠa é ba, eɠɛʋelei Zɛnvu Ɲadegai bosu la ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">«Ni wa GALA gooi mɛnina za,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>à mina wo-ɠigiti kpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛni la yeei kpakagi ɠɛɛni la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">suɠɔɠɔgi ma voloi teʋebai zu.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Miná ɠa wo-mɛmɛwolani ti sùɠɔɠɔni ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">tama ti nà-kɛɛwotiiti kaani kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni gè yiiɠaawanani niima yamanii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Ti ɠakagɛ nɔ ti-yiimaʋɛ yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">ti la nà-peleiti kwɛɛ.›<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, gè ɠonani ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‹Ti la lɔa nà-dooɠogi zu pɛ!› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Guy 95:7-11</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à dama, nui ta mina ɠɛ wo zaama, ɠi ɲɔi ʋa lɔ ziimaʋɛ, ta kidaaleʋelalai, é ʋa ʋoluave zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Kɛlɛ à ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔ folo-o-folo, ni nɔ «za voloi» ɠa dɛ ná, nii GALA daawooi ɓɔɛzu é ʋilɛ ba, wo zaama ta mina ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ná, kotoi ʋa yaava, é ʋa ɠikpa. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ da Kilista ɠa de ɓɔgai faa ɠila ma, ni da yɛna da-ladala mɔungi ʋolu kpaan, eyɛsu gaaɓela foloi zeeli. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Tama bogɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">«Ni wa GALA gooi mɛnina za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">à mina wo-ɠigiti kpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛni la yeei kpakagi ɠɛɛni la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Guy 95:7-8</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Ɓɛɛni ka ti GALA daawooi mɛnini, ti wuzeɠe daalɔɠɔma? Naati taade ɓaa, niiti Moize loni ti luɠɔ, ti ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Ɓɛɛni ka GALA ge yiiɠaawanani ti ma, kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu? Naati taade ɓaa, niiti ti kotoi ɠɛɛni, ti-ma ʋoomaiti ti yɛni teʋebai zu? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Ɓɛɛni ka é ɠonani ti ʋɛ ga ti la lɔa ná-dooɠogi zu? Naati taade ɓaa, niiti ti kololalai ɠɛɛni? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Da kaazu ɓalaa ga ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa lɔ GALA ná-dooɠogi zu, tɔɔzei ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai ʋa.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Deɠɛmu, yeeɠɛɠalai zu minazeɠegi ná la dɛ, ga nu lɔ GALA ná-dooɠogi zu, ade dama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo zaama, a wo ma ga é ɠulaa ʋoluzu. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laazeeliʋɛ ade ma, eɠɛʋelei daazeelini la ti ma. Kɛlɛ wooi daazeelini ti ma, naa la ɠɛni faa nɔpɛ paani ti ma, tɔɔzei niiti ti mɛnini, ti la ɠɛni yeezeini bu ga kidaaleʋei. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Adɛiti de ɠidaaleʋeai, da lɔɔzu dooɠogi zu, eɠɛʋelei GALA daawooi bogai la ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">«Nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, gè ɠonani ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‹Ti la lɔa nà-dooɠogi zu pɛ!› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Guy 95:11</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">GALA ge ɓɔɛni ɠana, anɛɛ ni ná-botiiti ti ɓega ga ɠɛ, kaite eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpɔɛʋɛ adaʋɛ ta folo lɔfelasiɛi vaa zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:4">«Foloi lɔfelasiɛi, GALA ge looɠoni ná-botiiti pɛ ba.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Zen 2:2</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>É bogɛ mɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:5">«Ti la lɔa nà-dooɠogi zu pɛ!»<verse eid="HEB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Tɔɔzei niiti ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi mɛnini mɔunpa, naati ti la lɔɔni ná, woozotalalai maaʋele ma, tama makɛgɛ tanigaani bɛ ga ti lɔ ná, <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>GALA ge folo ɠila devea ga niinɛ, nii é ga «za». Suɠoozaai ma, é puuni Davide la, naa bo, eɠɛʋelei bogai la maazuʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">«Ni wa GALA gooi mɛnina za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">à mina wo-ɠigiti kpa.»<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni Zozuwe dooɠogi veeni ti ya, GALA ge la ɓena ɓɔɛ ʋolu, é ʋa ʋilɛ foloi taɠili ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Dooɠo folo makɛgɛ dɛ GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti faa ma, nii kulaai ga folo lɔfelasiɛi, <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é lɔɔzu GALA ná-dooɠogi zu, naa ɠa looɠosu ná-botiiti ba, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge looɠoni la nɔnɔiti ba. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Ade ɠaaɓa, de lɔ naama looɠogi zu, nii a kɛ nu nɔpɛ ge mina loo bu ga é ʋa ʋokɔɠɔ naati ma, ti kololalai ɠɛɛni.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA daawooi ɠa vulua, zɛbɛi ɠɛ ba. Gaaliʋɛ é leʋe gaavele boɠa zɔkpɔi pɛ ba. Toɠa ɗa lɔ eyɛsu é zeeli ʋɛ zɛnvui ta nu ɠigi ti ɠomisu ná, eyɛsu é zeeli ʋɛ nu lodazuʋɛti ta nu ma ɓɔlɔgiti ti ɠomisu ná. Toɠa ɗa nu yii wɔinla vaiti ta ná-kisiɛiti buuzumɔ. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Kpɛtɛanii tanɔpɛ ge la lɔɔɠuni GALA gaazu, ti pɛ maaɲakaʋɛ, ti maaɠala naa ɠaazu, zɔi maanɛai de ʋoluvaawo ma.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Ade lo kpaan kidaaleʋei zu, nii de ma wooi wosu, tɔɔzei zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠa ade ya, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zuvologai, naa ɠa é ga Yesu, GALA Doun Zunui. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wola laade, é ʋa ɠɛ ade ya, ga nii é la zooga é ʋa de maawɔinɠa da-zɛbɛsulalai zu, kɛlɛ tɔun é tɛgai zɔlɔɔni fai pɛ su ga de ɠɛʋele, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni koto ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Deɠɛmu, ade maaɓuɠa GALA ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋa ga ladalai, ʋɛ zaalai zɔlɔɔsu ná. Ada maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔ ná ta zaalai, de kpɔba zɔlɔɔ, siɛgi zu de ɓɛdɛzu la ma.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai nii zeelobai ɠɛni wosu da nuɓusɛiti saama, ti seɠe ga é botii ɠɛ GALA bɛ ta-vaa ma, naa ɠa a kɛ é vebɛaniiti ta zalaɠaiti kula kotoiti ma vaa ma. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Toɠa zoo é faaɠwɛtala nuiti ta faaɠaaza nuiti ma vai ɠaaɠa, tɔɔzei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi, é ná-zɛbɛsulalai ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Tɔɔzei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi zɛbɛ la zea, kɛni é zalaɠai ɠula tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti faa zu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la naama losuʋɛ ma unfemai ɠɛa ga ɓɔɠɔ nɔnɔ, kɛni zɔi GALA ge toligai, eɠɛʋelei Aalɔn ɠɛni la. <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Kilista ɓalaagi la ɠɛni naama unfemai zeɠeni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ nɔ, ga é ʋa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, kɛlɛ é sɔlɔɔni GALA zea, nii é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">«Ɗa ga dòun zunui. Za, gè è ɠɛa ga dòin.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Guy 2:7</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Zenɔ ɠana bogai la adaʋɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">«Ɗa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">eɠɛʋelei Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Guy 110:4</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesu ɠɛai ma eteai zu, é falii ta maanɛɛnɛ wooiti daazeelini, é kpeei loo gola, gaazuɗɛiti ti ʋu, é daazeeli GALA ma, nii a la zoo é kizo saai ma. GALA ge gooɠaaʋotegi veeni zea, ná-woozogi maaʋele ma. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Anɛɛ ni é ɠɛni ga GALA Doun Zunui, é woozogi ɠalani ga naama vaiti maaʋele, é ɓɔlɔni ti zu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Tama tɛi daazeelini é zeeli ɠwɛgi ma, naa kɛɛʋɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ kizogi vee nui naati zea, niiti ti ɠolozu tɔun bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>GALA ge seini ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai eɠɛʋelei Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni la.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">À dama, wa ʋa ɠɛlɛ kidaaleʋei ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Faa mɔinmɔin ka gi ɠisu, gá zoo bosu naama vai zu, kɛlɛ kpaaʋɛ gi ʋa ti-ʋoluʋɛti bo wo ma, tɔɔzei wo la pɔ wo ʋa faiti gaaɠa fala. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Kaite wo maanɛɛni wo ɠɛ ga kalamɔinti, kɛlɛ wo ɓɛdɛi ɠa ba ga nu wo ɠala dɛ ga GALA ná-faiti ma lɔɔzei koiti, wo ɠɛa mɔnɔ ga nuiti ti ɓɛdɛi ɲiimiɗɛi ɓɔle vai ʋa, wo la ziɛzu daamiani kitei wu. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Zɔi ma é ɲiimii ɓɔlezu, naa ɠa dɛ ga doungoi, é la telebo kpɔɛiti zɔɠɔzuɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Kɛlɛ tama, daamiani kitei ɠa ga nui naati tɔnɔ, niiti ti ga nu ɠiteiti, ti zoogai faiti zɔɠɔzuɠulazu, faa ʋagɔi, ɓaa faa ɲɔi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, fai niiti ti ga Kilista laawooi zu vai ma ɠala mɔungi, ade naati zɛ lɛɛ ná dɛ, ade li luɠɔ faa ɓiigiti su, ade mina seɓasema la ga niinɛ ga: nu siɛ ʋelei maavalibo fai é zeɠe kɛɛwotiiti polu ti nu lɔɔzu saai zu, kidaaleʋei GALA ma, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>ɲade fai ma ɠɛɛwotiiti ma ɠalagi, nu yeei la nuiti ma, gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai, ta tukpɔi é ɠɛɛzu ga ɠɔoɠɔ kelei. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Naa ɠa ade ʋaazu kɛɛzu, ni GALA ka vaana bu.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Ade naati ta-vai ʋɛtɛna, niiti ti ɠalegai ma ʋolu ta-etea wɔlɔmai ma: Ti GALA ná-wozakalagi zɔlɔɔni. Naa ʋoluma ti geeɠɔlɔgi zu vebɛanii ɠɔɠɔ, ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zu. <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>Ti GALA daawoo ʋapagi wɔin ɠɛɛni. Etea niinɛi é ʋaazu, ti naa ná-zɛbɛi ɠaaɠa. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Naa pɛ poluma, ti ɠale ma ta-etea wɔlɔmai ma ʋolu. Naama nuiti, nu la mɔ zooga ti zeɠezu ti-ziɛ ʋelei ʋa, ti ʋa valibo. Tɔɔzei ta GALA Doun zunui ɓadɔzu ʋolu ga niina saa wului ma, ti zɛba ti yeeɠɛɠalai ve nu ɠiligiti zea ga ti GALA poomu kɛlɛi zu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Tama, siɛgi zu zooi yɛɓɛzu la ga tonai é ʋuuzu ma valafala, é zɛba é siinziin ganigiti pɔnɔ, niiti ti zoloogai tii ɠɛɛ nui ma, GALA ka tuya loo ma yooi ma. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Kɛlɛ ɠain dɔɓɔi a wuzeɠena, ta ɠain guluiti, kulanuma la mɔ ɠɛa ba, su la ɠooza é voovoo, gaa ɠa ɓela ga abui lo ba.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Kɛlɛ nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, anɛɛ ni gá ɓɔɛzu ɠani, gi laaʋɛ da ga wa pele ʋagɔi ma, nii soloogai kizogi ma. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>GALA ge la ga telebotala ƓALAGI, é ʋa yeema wa-wotiiti ma ta nɛɛbɛi wo kulani kɛlɛma daaseigi ma vaa ma, ga botiiti wo ti ɠɛɛni, ta wo ba dɛ, wo ɗa kɛ ná-nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Kɛlɛ wɔin ɠa gi ma ga wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ge naa ɠɛɠala ɠaaɓaai wo, eyɛsu gaaɓela foloi zeeli, naa ɠa a kɛ wa-ɠitogi pɛ daazeeli. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>À mina ɠɛ ga ɲaka nua, kɛlɛ anii niiti GALA ge minazeɠeai ga tiye, zɔiti ti ʋaazu tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔsu naati su ga ta-ɠidaaleʋei ta ta-yiilɔɔi maaʋele, à ʋokɔɠɔ naati ma.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-minazeɠe daazeeliai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Siɛgi zu GALA ge minazeɠegi woni da Abalaame ʋɛ, tɛi nu la ɠɛni ná, nii bɔɔlɔai tɔun ba, a la zoo ɠonazu ma, é ɠonani tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ma, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>é ɠɛ ma: «La da ga nà tuya loozu è ʋɛ, gè è-mavofodai ɠaawɔɔlɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Zen 22:16-17</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abalaame maaɓɔungi woni ga ziilɔɔi. Naa ma, é naa zɔlɔɔni, nii GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni nuiti ta ɠɛna konai woga, ta ɗa ɠona naa ma, nii bɔɔlɔai tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti ʋa, konai ɠa a ɗa maaɠaalii ta kpɔɛiti pɛ kpe ti yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ná-devei niiti ti la valiboga, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é naati dɛɛ ga naati, niiti é minazeɠeai ti ʋɛ ga tɔnɔi, é naa ɠulani kɛlɛma ga konai é boni. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Naazu é ade ʋilɛga faa felegɔ ɠakala, niiti ti la valiboga, niiti GALA ge la zooga zɛɛ wosu ti zu pɛ. Naama vaiti ta de ʋɛ ga iɲɔdɔɔ wola, dɛiti de faiti pɛ zɛgai ná, de kitogi naa zo kpaankpaan, nii ma minazeɠegi wogai ga é ve ade ya. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Kitogi naa ɠa ade ʋɛ, eɠɛ anii nii ade-yɛnvui lɔɔɓadɔgai ma, de laai da ta togai kpaan. Toɠa leʋesu, é lɔ ada ɲadegai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ada ɲadegai</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu, ada ɲadegai ɠɛni ga GALA kɛɛ vai ma nuiti saama.</char></note> ma ɠwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>ʋɛ Yesu ɠɛai ga nu mɔungi é lɛ ná ade luɠɔ ade ma vaa ma. Toɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai eyɛsu ɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni la.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlekizedɛke, masagi ta zalaɠa ɠula nui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni ga Salɛme masagi, é ɠɛni ga GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-zalaɠa ɠula nui. Siɛgi zu Abalaame ɠɛni ʋaazu la, é zeɠe kɔɔmaʋɛ, ʋɛ é pilɛ sɔlɔɔni ná masagiti ma, Mɛlekizedɛke daaɠomini, é tuya loo bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Tɔ ɠa Abalaame kɔɔzoganiiti pɛ ma ʋuusiɛi veeni zea. Mɛlekizedɛke laaseigi ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga «telebo masagi», naa ʋolu ɓalaa Salɛme masagi, nii poluʋɛ ga «ziilɛi masagi». <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>GALA Sɛʋɛi la kɛɛɠɛ ná-faa woni, ɓaa dee, ɓaa mɛmɛwolani mavofodai. É la sɔlɔɔ faa woni, ɓaa saa vaa. Ná-fai ʋokɔɠɔgɛ GALA Doun Zunui ná-fai ma, toɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Tama à naa wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ʋɛtɛ dɛɛ, nui nii mɛmɛwola Abalaame ɓɔɠɔi kɔɔzoganiiti pɛ ma ʋuusiɛi veeni zea. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Levi mavofodaiti ti ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, devei veai ti ya, eɠɛʋelei tɔgi la, ga ti puusiɛi ɠula ti-ɠɛɛlointi zea, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, tama ta naati ti pɛ ti ɠulaai Abalaame zu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Mɛlekizedɛke la ɠɛni ga Levi mavofodai ta, kɛlɛ é puusiɛi zɔlɔɔni Abalaame ya, é tuya loo naa ʋɛ, nii é GALA ná-minazeɠegiti sɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Tama maaɠaali nɔpɛ ge la naa zu, zɔi bɔɔlɔai, naa ɠa a ɗa tuyai loo naa ʋɛ, nii zeemaalɔiɗai. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Levi mavofodaiti ti aniiti ma ʋuusiɛiti feezu ti ya, ta ga nuiti ti zaazu, kɛlɛ Mɛlekizedɛke ɠa ga nui nii ná-faa wogai maaɓakpa ga toɠa vulua. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Tama Levi nii puusiɛi veezu zea, toɠa veezu naa ya ga Abalaame maaʋele. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni dɛ kɛɛɠɛ ɓusɛi zu, siɛgi zu Mɛlekizedɛke liini la naa laaɠomisu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠii <optbreak/> ga Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Tɔgi é veeni Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti zea ɠani, naa un ge zeini Levi zalaɠa ɠula ʋelei ʋa. Ni tama faiti pɛ gaavɔnini ga Levi nuiti ta-zalaɠa ɠula wotii, leeni ɠa a la nuɓusɛiti kpɛdɛ ɠɛ ʋolu zalaɠa ɠula nu ɠili ba, ga Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛʋele, nii é la ga Aalɔn ɠɛʋele? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu zalaɠa ɠula vai maavalibosu la, kɛni ɓalaa tɔgi maavalibo. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Tama, zɔi niima vaiti ti wosu ná-faa zu, naa ɠa ga bolodai taɠili su nu, nii su nui tanɔpɛ ge la dɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma wotii ta ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ koleʋɛ gola ga de-Maliɠii zɔlɔɔni Zuda ná-bolodai zu. Moize la ɠɛni faa nɔpɛ boni bolodai naa ná-faa zu, é ʋa ʋilɛ zalaɠa ɠula nu vaa ʋa.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Fai nii ɠa é niima vaiti pɛ kolezu mɔnɔ: Zalaɠa ɠula nu ɠili ge wuzeɠeni, nii é ɠɛni ga Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nu ɠiligi, naa la ɠɛni zeini ga tɔgi maaʋele nii togai é ʋilɛ nuɓusɛi mavofodai ʋa, kɛlɛ kɛni zɛnvui é la ɠoloɠologa, naa ná-zɛbɛi. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niima zeele wooi woni ná-faa zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">«Ɗa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">eɠɛʋelei Mɛlekizedɛke ɠɛni la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Guy 110:4</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa, devei ma mɔungi zeɠea ga, tɔɔzei ná-zɛbɛsulalai ʋa, ta kulanuma la ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgi la ani nɔpɛ daazeelini. Tama kitogi fizɔgai, nii de maaɓuɠazu GALA ba saɓu zu, naa ʋa potogi zu. <verse eid="HEB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Naama ge la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni GALA ná-kona wogai ʋolu. Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, kona vaa la ba. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula nui ga konai maaʋele GALA ge boni, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni tɔun ma la:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">«Maliɠii ɠonani, tama é la zeɠea woo ʋolu, é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‹Ɗa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui eyɛsu ɠɔ.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Guy 110:4</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Naa ma, Yesu ɠɛa ga minazeɠegi fizɔgai naa maazuɓaa nui.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>É ɓudɛ naa maazu, zalaɠa ɠula nu mɔinmɔingaa ti ʋaa ti leʋe, mazɔlɔɔ saai pele leʋeni ti luɠɔ, ga ti ʋa yɛ botii zu ɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ná-zalaɠa ɠula wotii la ɠulaa zea, é ʋa ve taɠili zea, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa vulua eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Naa ɠa é ba, toɠa zoo é naati kizo ga pagɔ, zɔiti ti maaɓuɠazu GALA ba ga tɔun maaʋele, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa vulua ɠɔoɠɔ ga é ɗa soloogi wo ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Yesu ɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, nii soloogai ade ma, ɲadegai, sɔ ge la ba, é la ɠɔzɔni, zɔɠɔzu ɠa ti ʋa ta kotoba nuiti, tɛɛʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Maavaa la ba, eɠɛʋelei zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai zɔiti ti la, ga folo-o-folo é ɗa zalaɠaiti kula tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-kotoiti faa zu, naa ʋolu nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti faa zu. É zalaɠai ɠula laa ɠɛni ɠila kpe nɔ ná ɓe, siɛgi zu é ɓɔɠɔ ɠulani la ga zalaɠai nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti faa zu. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Moize ná-tɔgi nuiti toni ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti, ti ga zɛbɛsulala nuiti. Kɛlɛ GALA ná-minazeɠe kona laawooi é woni tɔgi ʋoluma, naa ɠa é Doun Zunui zeiɗai ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, nii ná-fai pɛ daazeeliai eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu, ada-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Faiti gi ti wosu, nii ɠa é ga ma ɓii golai: Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠa ade yeema, toɠa zeini geeɠɔlɔgi zu, GALA Maayikiai ná-kpɔkpɔgi yeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Toɠa zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wola wotii ɠɛɛzu seizu ɲadegai, seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadega ɠitei wu, nii Maliɠii togai, nu laade é ʋa naa ɠɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti pɛ sei ungi ɠa ga, ti ɗa vebɛaniiti teʋe GALA pɔ ta ti ɗa zalaɠaiti kula. Fizɔgɛ ada-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɓalaagi ma ga ani ɠɛ zea, a teʋe. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Ni é ɠɛni eteai zu, é la ɓena ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nu, tɔɔzei zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta miná niina, niiti ti vebɛaniiti kulazu ga zalaɠai, eɠɛʋelei tɔgi bogai la. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Naati ta botii ɠɛɛzu, é nɔ ga geeɠɔlɔgi zu aniiti baaɠulabai, ta ti-maaniinigi. Zekana Moize tɛnɛ gooi zɔlɔɔni da, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai losu da. GALA ge ɠɛni ma: «Dama, è kɛ ga naama ɠazaʋigi nɔ, nii é lɛɛni ga ɗe gizei ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Ɛgz 25:40</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, Yesu ná-botii wɔɔlɔʋɛ tɔnɔi ʋa gola, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nui minazeɠe niinɛi ná-faa zu nii fizɔgai gola, nii kpɛtɛai ga minazeɠegiti ti vizɔgai.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠe pɔlɔmai ta ma niinɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Ni peelalazu la ɠɛni minazeɠe mɔungi ʋa, nu ɓɛdɛ la ɓena ɠɛ felesiɛ ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Tama zeli ɠa GALA ge ɠɛni tosu ná-nuɓusɛiti ma, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ti ma la:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">« ‹Naama voloiti ta ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">yeei gè ʋaazu minazeɠe niinɛi wosu da Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">ta Zuda nuɓusɛiti.› Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>‹É la ɠɛa eɠɛ minazeɠegi gè kɛɛni ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">voloi gè ti zoni da ti-yee ʋa, ga gè ti ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Ti la ɠɛɛni ga wooɠɛɠila nu nà-minazeɠegi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">nà ɓalaagi, gè ʋoluaveni ti ʋa,› Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">‹Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ minazeɠegi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">gè bosu Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">naama voloiti poluma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Nà nà-tɔgiti dɔ ta-ɠisiɛiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">gè ti zɛʋɛ ti-yiimaʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Nà ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ti ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Nu nɔpɛ kpɛdɛ la mɔ ɠɛa ba ga é seiɲɔɠɔ ɠala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">ɓaa kɛɛɠɛloun, é ʋa ɠɛ ma: Maliɠii ɠwɛɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ ta kwɛ̀ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">é zo doungoiti ma ti zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">é zeeli nu ɠiteiti pɛ ma.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ta-lelebotala vaiti suvaayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">gè la mɔ ta-ɠotoiti devea ti unma.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Zel 31:31-34</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>GALA ga ɠɛna minazeɠe niinɛi ma vaa woga, é ma mɔungi ɠɛa ga ma wɔlɔma. Tama zɔi kɛai ga ma wɔlɔmai, é wɔlɔzaɠaga, toɠa na ʋa ɲɛɛlɛzu.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">GALA dɛbi ʋelei eteai zu <optbreak/> ta geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Minazeɠe mɔungi zu, GALA dɛbi ʋelei ma leveiti ti ɠɛni ná, naa ʋɛɛ seizu ɲadegai ʋa, nii é ɠɛni ga eteai zu gelei. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai loni, é leʋeni su fele, ma ada mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga ada ɲadegai. Miná ɠa fitina zei anii ɠɛni ná, ta taɓalii, ta ɓuluiti ti veai GALA bɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Naa ʋolu kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi velesiɛi ʋoluʋɛ, adaʋɛ miná laaseigi ɠɛni ga ada ɲadega wolai. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ta minazeɠe kesui, niiti zanugi ziɛni ti maaʋɛ, naati ka ti ɠɛni miná. Zanu diɠii manegi ɠɛni su, ta Aalɔn ná-tukpɔi é ʋɔnɔni, ta kɔtu ɠokologiti niiti GALA ge minazeɠegi ma lɔgiti sɛʋɛni ti ma, naati ka ti ɠɛni kesui zu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Seeluɓɛinti ti ɠɛni minazeɠe kesui maazuʋɛ, ti dɛɛ ga GALA ka ná. Ti koto gbazuʋɛ maalɔɔɠuni ga ti-ɠoʋegiti maaniinigiti. Yeeɠɛɠala la de ya, de ʋa naama vaiti gilagilagi pɛ bo.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Anii naati pɛ ta-vai zeiɗai ma kpasu ɠana, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ɓena lɛ seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma ada mɔungi wu folo-o-folo, ti ɗa ta-wotii ɠɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Kɛlɛ adaʋɛ velesiɛi, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é ɓena lɛ miná, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ kona-o-kona, é la ɠɛni lɛa ná ni zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai la zea, é ʋa kula tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoi vaa zu, niiti ti la ti ɠɛɛni ga gaaɠilima. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa dɛɛzu naazu ga ada ɲadega wolai ma ʋelei laa la ɠɛni dɛ laoni, siɛgi zu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadega mɔungi ɠɛni ná la dɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Naati ta ga niizu vaiti ma ʋoogiti. Poluʋɛ ɠa ga vebɛaniiti ta zalaɠaiti ti ɠulazu ɠana GALA bɛ, ti la zooga ti ʋa naama nui ná-kisiɛi ma vaiti gaavɔni, nii é GALA dɛbizu ga kɛʋelei naa ma zii. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Tɔɔzei tɔgiti ta ga naati é lo daamianigiti ba, ta kpɔleɓɔle ganigiti, ta ɲade fai ma ɠɛɛwotiiti, kpusɛi ná-tɔgi naati ti zeini, eyɛsu ti valibo foloi zeeli GALA bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ná-zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Kɛlɛ Kilista ʋaani, é ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai é lo faa ʋagɔiti ba ti ʋaai niina. É seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maazuɓudɛni, nii bɔɔlɔai ta daazeeliai ga pagɔ, nii nuɓusɛa laade ti ʋa to, naa ɠa bosu ga é la ga eteai nii kpɛtɛai, naa nɔnɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>É lɛɛni ada ɲadega wolai, ná zeizu ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ. É la lɛɛni ná ga boliiti ɓaa nikɛ yiʋoiti ma ɲamai, kɛni tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ma ɲamai. Ʋele ɠana é ɠɔoɠɔ unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔni la ade ʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni bolii ma ɲamai ta nikɛ zinɛi nɔnɔi, ta nikɛ zaai ma yuʋui, é ɠɛni vazasu naati ma ti ɠɔzɔai, naa ɓena ti-ɓusɛi ɲade, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>deɠɛmu Kilista ma ɲamai vizɔgɛ naati ba gola, tɛigi é ɓɔɠɔ ɠulani ga zalaɠai GALA bɛ, kɔzɔzu la ba, ga Zɛnvui maaʋele, nii é ná ɠɔ. Ma ɲamai ɠa da-ɠisiɛiti ɲade kɛɛwotiiti ma ti nu lɔɔzu saai zu, ga de zoo de botii ɠɛ zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Naa ɠa é ba, toɠa ga minazeɠe niinɛi ma yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nui, naa ɠa a kɛ, zɔiti ti loligai, naati ti tɔnɔi zɔlɔɔ é yɛsu ná ɠɔoɠɔ, nii GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni ti ʋɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ saai ɠa bogai naama vaa zu, ga nuiti ti unmɔɔ, ti ɠula ta-ɠotoiti su, ti ti ɠɛɛni minazeɠe mɔungi ma ziɛgi zu.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ falima woo zɛʋɛi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛlɛke wooi zu, woo ɠilagi naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ga </char><char style="fq" closed="false">falima woo zɛʋɛi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ta </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">minazeɠegi.</char></note> ɠɛɛzu ná, soloogɛ ga falima woo zɛʋɛi ɠɛ nui ná-saa vai ɠɛ ga ɠite vaa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Tɔɔzei tosu nɔpɛ ge la falima woo zɛʋɛi ʋa, ni nɔ kɛɛ nui ɠa dɛ vulua, tosu ɠa ɠɛ ba nɔ ga siɛgi zu zɔi é sɛʋɛi laai poganii ma, naa zaazu la. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Naa ɠa é ba, minazeɠe mɔungi la vɔlɔ ɠɛni botii lɔɔzeini, kɛni ɲamai ʋuuni pɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Moize ɓegai ma ga deve wooiti pɛ bo nuɓusɛiti ma, eɠɛʋelei é la tɔgi zu, naa ʋolu é nikɛ yiʋoiti ma ɲamai zeɠeni, ta boliiti ma ɲamai, ta ziɛi, é faza sɛʋɛi ma ta nuɓusɛiti ma ga ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi, naa ʋɛɛ geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi tago ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>É ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga ɲamai nii é minazeɠegi maaɓakpasu, nii GALA ge deveai ga wo makɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Ɛgz 24:8</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Zenɔ ɠana Moize ɲamai vazani la seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma, ta aniɲakaiti pɛ ma, niiti ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye GALA dɛbi vai ma. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Tama, eɠɛʋelei tɔgi boni la, kɛni anii tanigaani nɔ, kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti ɲadeni ga ɲamai, kotoi zuvaa la yɛga, ni ɲamai la ʋuuni.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-zalaɠai ɠa é kotoi gbazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>É vizɔni deɠɛmu ga aniiti ti geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naati baaɠulabaiti maanɛɛni ti ɲade ɠana. Ta mɔnɔ, geeɠɔlɔgi zu ani ɠiteiti kpɛdɛi ɠa ba ga ti ɲade ga zalaɠaiti ti vizɔgai gola. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Kilista la lɛɛni seizu ɲadegai nii nuɓusɛiti ti kpɛtɛai ga yeei, a ɠɛ nɔ ga ma ɠitei ʋaaɠulabai, kɛlɛ tɛɛʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɔɠɔi zu, miná ɠa é loni ná ade ʋɛ GALA kakala. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>É ɓudɛ naa maazu, kona-o-kona zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni lɛɛzu seizu ɲadegai ga ɲamai nii é la ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi nɔnɔ. Kɛlɛ Kilista la ɠɛni lɛɛni geeɠɔlɔgi zu ga é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠula ga zalaɠai ná zeizu ʋa ɠɛ mɔinmɔin. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Ni naa ɠɛni de, a la ɓɔlɔ, saa laa mɔin, kaite eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma. Kɛlɛ kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ná zeizu ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi niizu, é kotoiti kpe ga é ɓɔɠɔ ɠula ʋelei ma ga zalaɠai. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Eɠɛʋelei deveai la nuɓusɛiti ma ga ti za, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, naa ʋoluma, tukpɔɠaaleʋei ʋa, <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>zekana nɔ, Kilista ɓalaagi ɠulani ga zalaɠai, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, é nuɓusɛi ma mɔinmɔin ná-kotoi ɓe, toɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma mɔnɔ, é la mɔ ga é ʋa é kotoi ɓe, kɛlɛ é naati kizo, niiti ti maaɓɔunsu.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Moize ná-tɔgi zu vai ɠɛni nɔ ga faa ʋagɔiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu, naati maaniinigi. É la ɠɛni ga ti-ʋaaɠulaba ɠiteɠitegi ɓɔɠɔi. Naa ma, é la ɠɛni zooga é ʋa naati kɛ ga nui niiti ti laazeeliai, niiti ti ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu GALA ba, ga naama zalaɠa zii ɠilagiti nɔ, ti ɠɛni ɠulazu yeenɔpɛ kona-o-kona. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Ni é ɠɛni ta-vaiti daazeelini mɛtu, niiti ti ɠɛni naama zalaɠaiti kulazu, ta la looɠo ti ɠula vai ʋa? Mazɔlɔɔ ná a la ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ ti ɲade, ta-ɠisiɛi la mɔ ɠɛni ɓɔlɔa ga ta-ɠotoiti faa. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Kɛlɛ gaamazu, zalaɠai naati ta nu ɠitoozu kotoi ná-fai zu kona-o-kona. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nikɛ zinɛiti ta boliiti ma ɲamai la zooga é ʋa kotoiti kpe.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Kilista ʋaai ma eteai zu, é ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">«È la wɔinni ga zalaɠai ɓaa vebɛanii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">kɛlɛ kpusɛ ɠa è kpɛtɛai bɛ̀.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Gala zalaɠaiti ɓaa koto gba zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">ti la è yiilɛini.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Gè ɠɛni ma naazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">‹Ee, GALA, wɛlɛ, pàaʋɛ ga gè è-yiimai ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">eɠɛʋelei bogai la nà-faa zu sɛʋɛi zu.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5-7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:7-9">Guy 40:7-9</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>É boni mɔunpa ga: «È la wɔinni ga zalaɠaiti ɓaa vebɛaniiti, anɛɛ gala zalaɠaiti ɓaa koto gba zalaɠaiti ti la è yiilɛini.» Tama niima zalaɠaiti ta ɠulazu eɠɛʋelei tɔgi bogai la. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, GALA, wɛlɛ, pàaʋɛ ga gè è-yiimai ɠɛ.» É faa mɔungi zeɠeni ga ɠana, ga é felesiɛi zei. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Naama yiimai maaʋele ma, de ɲadega Yesu Kilista ɓusɛi vee vai zu de ʋɛ, é ɠula ga zalaɠai, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, é ɠwɛ naa ʋa.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nu kpein ka ɗa botii ɠɛ folo-o-folo, é ɗa zalaɠai ma zii ɠilagiti nɔ ɠula, niiti ti la zooga ti ʋa kotoiti kpe pɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Kɛlɛ Kilista mu, kpegai ma ga zalaɠa ɠila kpegi ɠula kotoi zuvaayɛ fai zu, é ga tɔnɔ eyɛsu ɠɔ, naa ʋolu é zeini GALA zeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Toɠa zeini miná niina, eyɛsu GALA ge sili nuiti kɛ ga ná-kɔɠɔloma anii. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zalaɠa ɠilagi maaʋele ma, é naati ta-vai laazeelia mɛtu, zɔiti é ti ɲadegai.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa naa wosu, é maaɓakpa ade ʋɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ kpegai ma ga ɠɛ ma dɛ:<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>«Maliɠii wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Wɛlɛ minazeɠegi ʋa gè bosu ti ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">naama voloiti poluma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Nà nà-tɔgiti dɔ ti-yiimaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">gè ti zɛʋɛ ta-ɠisiɛiti su.»<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>É ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">«Gè la mɔ ta-ɠotoiti ta ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti devea ti unma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16-17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Zel 31:33-34</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Tama, siɛgi zu kotoi zuvaayɛsu la, kotoi ma zuvaayɛ zalaɠa ɠula vaa la mɔ ba.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ade maaɓuɠa GALA ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ladalai ɠa de ya, ga de viegɛ ga de lɔ ada ɲadega wolai, Yesu ɲamai zaalai zu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>É pele niinɛ laalaoga ade ʋɛ, é vulua, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋɛ, pelei nii é ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɓusɛi. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Naa ma, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠa é ade ya, é zeini GALA ná-pɛlɛi unda. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Deɠɛmu ade maaɓuɠa GALA ba, ga de-yii ɲadegai, ta kidaaleʋe laazeeliai, de-yiiti ɲadegai kisiɛ ɲɔi pɛ ma, de-ɓusɛi gbaai ga ziɛ ɲadegai. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Ade da-ɠitogi zo kpaan, nii ade ma vaa wosu, mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é minazeɠegi wogai, toɠa ga wooɠɛɠila nu. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Ɛsɛ ge wɛlɛ bɔɔla ma, ade ɠilagilagi pɛ, ga de ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔ nɛɛbɛi ziɛ vai zu, ta kɛɛwoti ʋagɔiti kɛɛ vai. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Ade mina ɠɛ ga tanigaani kɛʋele, de ʋa ɠɛlɛ da-maaɓɔgi ʋa, kɛlɛ ade ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔ, eɠɛʋelei vɔlɔ wo ɠaazu Maliɠii ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi ʋa la, maa ɗa ɓuɠa.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ de gaamai ɠwɛɛga ʋoluma, ni da ɠɛna kotoi ɠɛa kenein ga gaaɠilimai, zalaɠa nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ná ade ʋɛ, nii a kotoiti kpe, <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>kɛni nɔ niina tukpɔi maaɓɔun fai ma luai, ta abuzo golai kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é kpaka nuiti gala! <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Nui ta a la Moize ná-tɔgi ɠoloɠolona, ti la ɠɛni maawɔinɠaa, ti ɓena paa, ga zeele felegɔ ɓaa saʋagɔ ná-zeele wooi maaʋele. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Nimizai ma zii ɓɛgele ɠa maanɛai é zei naama nui ma, zɔi é ɓaaɠulazu GALA Doun Zunui ma, ta minazeɠegi GALA ge bogai, naama ɲamai é naa leve ga wafuun faa, nii é tɔun ɲadeni, é Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋoomu, nii zaalai zɔlɔɔsu ga maaʋele? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Mazɔlɔɔ de naa ɠwɛɛ, zɔi é ɠɛni ma: «Nà ɠa gè ga potokula nui, nà ɠa gè ɛsɛ gilagilagi zalazu!» É ɠɛ ma mɔnɔ: «Maliɠii ɠa ná-nuɓusɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">TSV 32:35-36</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Naa maayikiʋɛ, ga nu loo zɛnvu su ƓALAGI yeezaama!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>À ɠizɛ naama volo mɔungiti su, wo ɓegai ma ga GALA ná-wozakalagi zɔlɔɔ, wo ɓɔlɔni gola, kɛlɛ wo loni kpaan, wo kɔɔ ɲɔi naa ɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Wo tanigaa ti ɠɛni ʋoomusu, ti zopele ɗa ɲɔu kɛlɛi zu, zɔiti ma ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai wo zaama ga ti ɓɔ naati ba, niiti ti ɠɛni ti zopele ɲɔuzu ɠana. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔni kasoɠa nuiti ta-ɓɔlɔi zu, wo va bu ga koozunɛ wo-yeaɠɔligiti ti ɗa ɠula wo ya, mazɔlɔɔ wo ɠɛni kwɛɛ ga ania zɔlɔɔga niiti ti vizɔgai, ti yɛsu ná ɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>À mina ɠɛlɛ wa-ladalai ʋa, kulanuma wolai ɠa ba. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Wo ɓɛdɛi ɠa ziilɔɔi ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ wo naa ɠɛ, nii é ga GALA ziimai, wo ʋa naa zɔlɔɔ, nii é ma minazeɠe bogai. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">«Ná tago nɔ ʋe niina, su la mɔ ɠoozani,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 26:20">Eza 26:20</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">zɔi maanɛai é ʋa, toɠa ʋa niina, é la mɔ lɛbisu.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Zɔi telebogai gàazu, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">kɛlɛ ni a ɠalena ma ga ʋoluʋelei, ná-fai la zoga zìi ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:37-38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Aɓk 2:3-4</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Adɔun, de la ga naama nuiti, niiti ti ɠalesu ma ga ʋoluʋelei, ti undaaʋili, kɛlɛ ada ga nuiti kidaaleʋei ti ya, ada ɠizosu.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa ga nu laa faiti da niiti kitogai ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ga zaɓui nu naama ɠaamaiti kwɛɛ, niiti nu la ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Naama ɠidaaleʋei é ɠɛni wɔlɔwɔlɔ nuiti zea, naa ɠa é kɛɛni, ti zeele woo ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔni GALA zea.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa ade kwɛɛsu da ga eteai ɓɛtɛni ga GALA daawooi, anii niiti de ti ɠaazu, naati kpɛtɛʋɛ, ti ɠula naati su, niiti nu la ti ɠaazu.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa Aɓɛle zalaɠai ɠulani la GALA bɛ, nii é vizɔni Kayɛn nɔnɔi ʋa. Ná-kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, GALA ge dɛɛni ga telebogɛ, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi zeele wooi wo ga é yeezeini ná-vebɛaniiti bu. Aɓɛle ná-kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, toɠa ɓɔɛzu zaaɠaza, anɛɛ ni saaʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Enɔke lɛɛni GALA pɔ bɛ, é la ɠɛni zaani, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni kaani mɔnɔ pɛ, tɔɔzei GALA ge seɠeni. Mazɔlɔɔ aisa é ʋa lɛ, é zeele wooi zɔlɔɔni ga é GALA ziimani. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Tama, é ɠula kidaaleʋei ʋolu, nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa GALA ɛnɛkɛ. Naa ma, zɔi é ʋaazu GALA pɔ, kɛni é ɠidaaleʋe ga GALA ka ná, toɠa kulanuma ve naati zea, niiti ti gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa Nowe woiloni la GALA ná-tɛnɛ gooiti ma, é ʋilɛ faiti ba ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, nu la ɠɛni dɛ ti ɠaazu. É ɠoloni GALA gooi ʋɛ, é keingi ɓɛtɛni, nii ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋuuni su, ti ɠizo. É eteai ʋeelalani ga naa. Naa maaʋele ma, é ɠɛɛni ga telebodai ma ʋogani zeɠe nui, nii é zɔlɔɔsu ga kidaaleʋe maaʋele.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Abalaame GALA gooi zoni, siɛgi zu naa tolini la ga é li zooi ta zu, nii é ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu ga nɔnɔ. É liini, anɛɛ ni é la ɠɛni ná ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni é liini, é zei minazeɠe zooi naa zu, é ɠɛ ga seikɔɠɔma nu. Ti zeini seɠe ɠotaiti bu, ta Izaake, naa ʋɛɛ Zakɔɓe ʋa, tɛiti ti ɓɔni zooi zɔlɔɔ fai ma minazeɠegi ma. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Abalaame ɠɛni naama laai maaɓɔunsu, nii ma seɓasemai ɓaai kpe, GALA ge ga kazaʋi nui ta to nui.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni zobo ge veeni Abalaame ʋɛ, ga é mavofoda zɔlɔɔ, anɛɛ ni pɔlɔzaɠaga ɠɛni de niina, ta Sala ɓalaa ɠɛni ga doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanui. É laani minazeɠe bo nui ná-wooɠɛɠiladai la. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zunu ɠilagi tɛi, nii pɔlɔzaɠagi maaʋele ma, saai maaɓuɠaa ɠɛni de ba niina, mavofoda mɔinmɔin ge ɠulani su, eɠɛ somideɠaiti ti geezuʋɛ, ta ɲaɠaegi ti kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Ti pɛ ti yɛni kidaaleʋei zu eyɛsu ti za. Ti la ɠɛni naama aniiti sɔlɔɔni, niiti ti ma minazeɠegi woni. Kɛlɛ ti ti ɠaani, ti yeezeini ti wu ga ʋelela ʋele vaiti ti ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, ti kwɛɛni ga ta ga wɛɛinti ta seɠeseizu nuiti eteai zu. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Niiti ti ɓɔɛzu ɠani, koleʋɛ ga ta dɛɛzu ga ta zou ɠaiziɛzu. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Zooi ti zeɠeni su, ni naa wɔin ɠɛni ti ma, ta la yeeɠɛɠala zɔlɔɔ, ti ɠale ma náʋɛ ʋolu. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Kɛlɛ gaamazu zooi fizɔgai, naa ɠa wɔin ti ma, nii é ga geezu gelei. Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ge la unfega ga é ʋa loli ga ta-ƓALAGI, mazɔlɔɔ é taa ɓɛtɛʋɛ ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Abalaame Izaake ɠɛɛni ga zalaɠai, siɛgi zu GALA ge suɠɔɠɔni da. É ɠɛnina ná-doun zunu ɠila kpegi ɠulazu ga zalaɠai, tɛigi é minazeɠegiti sɔlɔɔni, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>GALA ge boni ma ma yeeluɠɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Izaake ɠa è-mavofodai a ɠula su.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Zen 21:12</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Abalaame ɠisiɛni ga zɛbɛ ɠa GALA zea ga é Izaake wuzeɠe saai ya. Tama GALA ge ná-doun zunui veeni zea ʋolu, eɠɛ naa a wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Izaake tuya looni Zakɔɓe ta Ezawu ʋɛ, é ʋilɛ ʋelela ʋele vaiti ba.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Zakɔɓe zaazuʋɛ, é tuya looni Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti gilagilagiti pɛ bɛ, é nɔkɔni, sɛlɛgai ga ná-tukpɔi ma ungi.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Zozɛfe maaɓuɠaai ma ná-eteai ɠaaɓelasuʋɛ ʋa, é ɓɔɛni é ʋilɛ Izilayɛle nuiti kula vai ʋa Ezipete yooi zu, é devei veeni ga ʋelei ta ma ɠaeiti ta-vai zo da.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Moize zɔlɔɔgai ma, ná-nuiti ti dɔɔɠuni alu saʋagɔ laawu, tɔɔzei ti kaani ga doungoi ʋagɛ gola, ti la ɠɛni luani masagi ná-devei ɠoloɠolo fai ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Moize wɔɔlɔai ma, é ɠɛlɛni ga nu mina toli ga Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>É yiimazeɠeni ga maanɔɠɔ GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti saama, kɛlɛ tɔun é mina ɠoozunɛ yeeɠɛɠala goi laawu kotoi zu. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>É pɛtɛni ga nu wɔinzeɠemai zɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei Kilista ɠɛni ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu la, naa wola vizɔgɛ, é leʋe Ezipete naavoloiti pɛ ba, mazɔlɔɔ gaazu ɠɛni ʋelela ʋele ɠulanumai ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Moize zeɠeni Ezipete yooi zu, é la ɠɛni luani masagi ná-ziiɠulagi ʋa. É loni kpaan, eɠɛ a ɠɛ GALA kaazu, nii nu la kaa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni é <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> fɛtii lɔɔzeini, é devei ve ga ti ɲamai vaza pɛlɛlaʋɛti, naa ɠa a kɛ faa zuɠoloɠolo geezuɠeelai mina Izilayɛle loun zunu mɔungiti paa.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ti Kpoloɗɛ Ɓɔigi leʋeni, eɠɛ nu a ɠɛ ziɛzu zou vɔɔi ma. Siɛgi zu Ezipete nuiti ti ná zuɠɔɠɔni da, ti yɛni ziɛi wu.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni Zeliko ziɠigiti ti looni, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti yɛni latisu da ma, é ɠɛ ga folo lɔfela. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Kidaaleʋei ɠa é kɛɛni koloɠolo anzanui Laɠaɓe la ɠɛni yɛni naati ba, ti ʋa za, niiti ti la ɠɛni ɠoloni GALA bɛ, tɔɔzei é nɛnɛgiti soni ga pagɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Leeni ɠa nà bo niina? Mazɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠala la mɔ zèa, gè ʋa Zedeyɔn ná-faa wo, ta Ɓalake, naa ʋɛɛ Samesɔn, ta Zɛfeté ʋa, ta Davide, é ʋɛɛ Samiyɛle, ta GALA goo wo nuiti ba. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, ti vɔnini masagiti ma, ti telebodaiti kɛ, ti aniiti sɔlɔɔ niiti GALA ge minazeɠeni ga tiye, ti zalaiti daaɠuluni, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>ti abu wolaiti paani, ti ɠulani boɠa zɔkpɔ ɠaaligiti zea, zɛbɛ la ɠɛni ti ʋa, tama ti zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔni, ti ɠɛni ga zɛbɛsu nuiti kɔɔmaʋɛti, ti vɔnini zii ɠiligiti ta-ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti ma. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, anzanui tanigaani Ta-wɔvɛiti ti wuzeɠeni, ti ɠula saai ya, ti ve ti ya. Ti tanigaani nimizani, kɛlɛ ti la yeezeini ti unmɔɔ faa wu ɲɛgɛlɛin, naa ɠa a kɛ ti buzeɠei zɔlɔɔ nii fizɔgai gola. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Tanigaani ti ɲɛɛɠulasui zɔlɔɔni, ta doɠai, tanigaa ti ɠilini ga yɔlɔɠɔiti, ti ti ʋili kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Ti tanigaani sɔɔni ga kɔtui, ti ti ʋaa, ti tanigaani bali su ga sii, ti za, ti tanigaani paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Ti ɠɛni ziɛziɛsu adaʋɛ pɛ, ti maaɠiliai ga baala kɔlɔiti ta boli ɠɔlɔiti, ti ʋalani ti-ɠɔligiti pɛ ma, ti ti wɔinzeɠe, ti ti zopele ɲɔu. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Ti ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu teʋebaiti su, ta gizeiti ma, ti ɗa zei pugiti su, ta zooi ma yeɠeiti su, tɛigiti eteai la ɠɛni zolooni ti ma.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>GALA ge yeezeini niima nuɓusɛiti pɛ bu ga ta-ɠidaaleʋei maaʋele. Tama ti la ɠɛni naa zɔlɔɔni, nii GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge faa ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ade ʋɛ nii fizɔgai. Ti maa la nɛɛni ti laa ʋa zeeli, ni ade-ʋɔ ge la ba.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">De yiilɔɔ ʋoluɠulai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Adɔun, de maaɠooliʋɛ ga zeele ʋɛbɛ wolai. Naa ɠa é ba, ade kasɔiti pɛ pili ya, ta kotoi nii é de maavelevelesu vaa. Ade kpizɛi wo ga ziilɔɔi, suɠɔɠɔ bosuʋɛ naa de luɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>De ɠaazulo Yesu ʋa kpaan, nii é kidaaleʋei lɔɔzeiɗa de ʋɛ, é liizu la eyɛsu daazeeli. É vaani bu ga ti paa saa wului ma, é la naama zaa zii leveni ga unfe faa nɔpɛ, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni koozunɛɛi ɠwɛɛ, makɛga ɠɛni de tuɠɔ, toɠa zeini niina GALA ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi yeezazuʋɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>À ɠigaiziɛ lɛɛ tɔun su, ʋelei é yiilɔɔni la naama laazuɠɔli vaiti bu, kotoba nuiti ti ti zeini ma. Naa ɠa é ba, à mina ɓɔlɔ, wo iɲɔ ge mina leʋe. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo la dɛ ɲɛpii ɠɔɔni kotoi laalɔɠɔma eyɛsu wo ʋa zeeli saai ma. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Wo yeema iɲɔdɔɔ wooiti ma GALA ge bosu wo ma, eɠɛʋelei a ɗa wo da doun zunuiti ma ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">«Dòun zunu, mina Maliɠii ná-maaɠoloi ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">mina iɲɔteʋe siɛgi zu é zelii losu da è ma.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii Maliɠii nɛai ʋɛ, naa ɠa a ɗa maaɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">toɠa ɗa naati ta-vaa ɲɔiti daazale, zɔiti é ti ɠwɛɛ ga ná-doun zunuiti be.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">TFa 3:11-12</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>À yiilɔɔ maaɠoloi wu, GALA ka wo zosu eɠɛ ná-doun zunuiti. Mazɔlɔɔ naama loun zunui ɠa mini, nii kɛɛɠɛ la ɗa ga maaɠoloa? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Pelegi é ɛsɛ pɛ maaɠolozu la, ni wo la maaɠoloi zɔlɔɔni ɠana, wa ga wɛɛn lointi, wo la ga doun zunu ɠitea. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Tama, de zɔlɔɔ kɛɛɠɛiti ti ɠɛni de maaɠolozu eteai zu, de ɗa unfe ti ma. De la ɓudɛzu naa maazu ɓaa, de ʋa ɠolo de-Ɠɛɛ ʋɛ, é geezuʋɛ, de ʋa zɛnvui wo? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Ade-ɠɛɛni ti ɠɛni de maaɠolozu yeeɠɛɠala go vaa nɔ ma, eɠɛʋelei é zolooni da ti ɠaazu. Kɛlɛ GALA ka de maaɠolozu da-ɠulagaanɛɛzu ɠitei ma vaa ma, naa ɠa a kɛ, de dɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-ɲadedai zu. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Gaama ʋe ga maaɠolo vaa nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga ɠɛ ga koozunɛ vaa tɔɔzeizuʋɛ, kɛni ziiɓɔlɔi. Kɛlɛ su a ɠoozana, zɔiti ti naa ɠɛɠala maaɠoloi zɔlɔɔsu, ta ɗa ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti ti ziilɛigi zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à wo-yeeiti sulo ʋolu, niiti ti zuɓɔlɔai. À wo-ɲiibiiti sasulɔ, niiti ti zuɓalizu. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>À ziɛ ga pele zɔlegiti, naa ɠa a kɛ dɛkpu ɠɔɠɔi mina ɠale siɛi wu, kɛlɛ tɔun é ɠɛdɛ.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deveiti ta tookisuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>À ɠaaɓa, ziilɛigi ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa nuɓusɛiti pɛ, ta wo ziɛ ɲadedai zu, é ɠula naa ʋolu, nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa Maliɠii ɠa. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>À dama ga nu nɔpɛ ge mina ʋala GALA ná-zaalai ma. Nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ ga ani zuwu ɲɔi, é ʋa ʋɔnɔ, é ʋa kpɔlɔi wuzeɠe, é ʋa ma mɔinmɔin kɔzɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo zaama ga koloɠolo nui, ɓaa faa ɲadegaiti pɛlɛʋɛlɛ nui ga Ezawu ɠɛʋele, niigi daamii laa ɠila kpegi vaa zu, é ná-doun mɔun tosuʋɛ ʋɔdini. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Wo kwɛni ga naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é kɛɛɠɛ ná-tuyai zɔlɔɔ, kɛlɛ naa ʋoluaveni ba, mazɔlɔɔ zobo nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni ná, kɛɛɠɛ ʋa naa maavalibo, nii kɛai niina,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kɛɛɠɛ ʋa naa maavalibo, nii kɛai niina</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mazɔlɔɔ zobo ge la veeni bɛ, é ʋa ɠɛʋelei valibo</char></note> anɛɛ ni é ɠɛni gaiziɛzu ga gɔlɔi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Wo la maaɓuɠani naama ɠizei ʋa, ga Izilayɛle nuiti kɛʋele teʋebai zu, nii nu a zoo é vɔɔɠu ba, abui sosu ba, kpidii ʋɛɛni ma, ná zuɓidiai, fiilɛ wolai ná, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>ta puʋu gooi, ta wooiti ti ɠɛni mɛnisu, nuiti ti ɠɛni mɛnisu, naati ti maanɛɛnɛi woni ga woo nɔpɛ ge mina mɔ wo ti ma ʋolu. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni zoosu ti ʋa ziɛ devei naa wu ga: «Anɛɛ suai nɔpɛ a vɔɔɠuna gizei ʋa, toɠa zɔɔ ga kɔtui, é za.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Ɛgz 19:12-13</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Naama vai maaluani gola, eyɛsu Moize ɠɛni ma: «Gè lua gola, gè ɗa ɓali!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">TSV 9:19</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo maaɓuɠaa Siyɔn gizei ʋa, zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ná-taai, Zeluzalɛme nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta ná-geezuɠeela ɓulu golaiti ti koozunɛɛi zu. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Wo maaɓuɠaa doun mɔungiti ba, ti-laaseigi zɛʋɛai geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ti maaɓɔgai ta-ɠaalɛbai zu. Wo maaɓuɠaa GALA ba, nuɓusɛiti pɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui, ta telebo nuiti ti-yɛnvuiti ba, ta-vai pɛ daazeeliai niina. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Wo maaɓuɠaa Yesu ʋa, é ga minazeɠe niinɛ ma yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nui, ta tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɲamai nii fazagai, é ɓɔɛzu ga pagɔ, é leʋe Aɓɛle nɔnɔi ʋa.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>À dama deɠɛmu! Wo mina ɓe woilosu naa wooi ma, nii é ɓɔɛzu wo ʋɔ. Niiti ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni ti ʋa woilo naa wooi ma, nii é ɠɛni ti lɛnɛsu eteai zu, undaaʋiligi la ɠɛni ʋoolani ti ʋa. Ada ma, da ɠizo ɠale, ni da ʋoluavena naa ʋa, nii é ɓɔɛzu de ʋɔ, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɗa de lɛnɛ? <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Mɔungi, daawooi zooi ɓalini, é niima minazeɠegi wogɛ de ʋɛ niizu ga: «Nà ʋaazu zooi ɓalizu ʋolu mɔnɔ ná ɠɛ ɠila, kɛlɛ é la ɠwɛ su naa ʋa, nà geeɠɔlɔgi ɓalaa ɓali.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Azé 2:6</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Naama wooi é ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ʋolu mɔnɔ ná ɠɛ ɠila,» naa ɠa dɛɛzu ga aniiti ti ɓɛtɛai, naati ta ɲiikpisu, ti ɲɛɛlɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, niiti ti la ɲiikpiga, naati ti yɛ ná ɠɔ.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Deɠɛmu ade ɠɛ ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ nuiti, tɔɔzei ada masadai zɔlɔɔsu nii é la ɲiikpiga. Ade GALA dɛbi ga kɛʋelei nii soloogai de ɗa fe bɛ, ga unfema ʋele ta duabai. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ da-ƓALAGI ɠa ga abui nii é anii pɛ galazu.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ʋelei nu a GALA ɛnɛkɛ da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>À mina yeeɓe ɠɛɛɠɛloun nɛɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>À mina ɓe wɛɛn zɛsɛbo fai ʋa eyɛsu pɛ, mazɔlɔɔ tanigaani ti yɛgɛ kɛɛzu ti geezuɠeelaiti daazuʋɛɛni, ti la suɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>À yiizoolɛ ga kasoɠa nuiti, eɠɛ wa tiyani ka wo kasoi ɠa ʋɔɔma. À ɠizɛ maanɔɠɔ nuiti su, eɠɛ wa ɠɛ faa ɠila ma wa tiye kpusɛi zu.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge unfema ve vului ʋɛ, zinigi ta anzai ti ɠɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nua ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka koloɠolo nuiti ta wɛɛnziɛ nuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>À mina walii nɛɛ ʋɛ, é ʋa zei wo unda. Nii é wo ya, naa wo ɛnɛkɛ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ɓɔɠɔi bogɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la yeeɓega è ʋa, gè la ɠɛlɛa è ʋa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛti: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">TSV 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Zoz 1:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, da zoo bosu ga ladalai pɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">«Màliɠii ɠa ga nà-kpɔba nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">gè la lua ani nɔpɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Leeni ɠa nui a zoo é kɛ ga ze?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Guy 118:6</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>À ɠizɛ wa-lotuɠɔiti su, niiti ti GALA daawooi laazeelini wo ma, wo ta-eteai ɠaaɓela ʋelei ʋɛtɛ, wo ʋokɔɠɔ ta-ɠidaaleʋei ma. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesu Kilista ɠa ga tɔnɔ wogi, ta za, eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>À mina va bu kala kiligiti ma ziiti, ti ʋa wo ɠaka. Mazɔlɔɔ fizɔgɛ ga de-yii zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔ ga GALA ná-zaalai maaʋele, é mina ɠɛ ga deveiti ti ʋilɛgai ɠɔnɔ faiti ba, nii é la faa nɔpɛ paani naati ma, niiti ti ʋoluzeini ba.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu seizu ɲadegai wu, ma zobo ge la veeni ti ʋɛ ga ti ʋa naa ta mi, nii kulaai ada-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ suai niiti zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni ti ma ɲamai ɠulazu ga zalaɠai, ada ɲadega wolai, koto zuvaayɛ fai zu, ti ma ʋoomai ɠɛni ɠalazu ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Yesu ɓalaagi zaani taa ʋoluʋɛ, nii a kɛ é ná-nuiti ɲade ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɲamai. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Deɠɛmu ade li pɔ bɛ puuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, de naa ɠɛɠala ʋɛlɛlalai ma zii zɔlɔɔ ga tɔun kɛʋele. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ taa la de ya zooi ma a lɛbi eyɛsu ɠɔ. Ada taai ɠaiziɛzu nii é ʋaazu. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Tɔun saɓui zu, ade mina ɓe ada-maamusɛi vee vai ʋa GALA bɛ ga zalaɠai, naa ɠa é ga de-lakɔlɔgiti ta-ɠulanuma, niiti ti kwɛɛsu kɛlɛzu kpaun ga tɔ ɠa é ga Maliɠii. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>À mina yeema faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai ma, ta nu ɠɔɔ vai, naama zalaɠa ziiti ka ti nɛai GALA bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>À wa-lotuɠɔiti goo zo, wo ɠolo ti ʋɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ tiya ɠa ti ɠaaɓaazu wo-yɛnvui ma, tɔɔzei ta ʋoluvaawo GALA ma ga ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti. Wa ɠolona ti ʋɛ, ta ti-losuʋɛ ɠɛ ga koozunɛɛi. Ni naa laade, ta kɛ ga gaazuɠilii, naama ge la ɠɛa wo ʋɛ ga kulanuma.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>À ɗa GALA fali gi ʋɛ. Gi laaʋɛ da ga kisiɛ ʋagɔ ɠa gi ya, gá pɔ ga gi ziɛ ga pagɔ fai pɛ su. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Nà laalazu maazu ga wo GALA falii ɠɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, su mina ɠooza, gè ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>GALAGI nii é ziilɛigi veezu, naa ade-Maliɠii Yesu wuzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, é ɠɛ ga ná-baalagiti makɛ nu wolai, é ɠɔoɠɔ minazeɠegi ɠili ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ma ɲamai, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>GALAGI naa zɛbɛi ve wo ʋɛ faa ʋagɔi pɛ kɛɛ vai zu, nii a kɛ wo ziimai laazeeli. É ziimai laazeeli wo-yiimaʋɛ ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele. Lɛbiyai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ ɠɔoɠɔ! Amina!<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ goo ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ga wo yeezei niima lɛnɛ gooiti bu, mazɔlɔɔ nii gè sɛʋɛai wo ma niima zɛʋɛi zu, gè la suɠoozani. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Nà bosu wo ma ga ade-ɠɛɛloin Timɔte ʋilɛgɛ niina. Ni a ʋaana ʋɛ fala, nà ɠɛna ʋaa wo ʋɛtɛsu, gá yɛ ʋa gi ʋa.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>À wa-lotuɠɔiti pɛ tuʋɔ bɛ̀, ta GALA ná-nuiti pɛ. Itali geleiti pɛ ta wo luʋɔsu.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>GALA ná-zaalai yɛ wo pɛ wo ʋa!<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
